      "revision": 1316274043,
      "text": "Anthonotha macrophylla is a shrub to small understory tree within the family Fabaceae. It is endemic to the rain forest regions of West Africa and it is the most common of species within the Anthonotha genus in Africa."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Anthonotha macrophylla",
