        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1316274043,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "Seed is used in some food preparations, stem bark is used to treat venereal and intestinal ailments and a leaf decoction is used to teat jaundice,  Stems are used as staking materials for yam and wood is obtained as firewood.",
